1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,100
Glimpse answers questions from your screen, right in the page.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,100
Open any page with a question on it.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:12,100
Press Alt+Shift+S and drag around the question (Alt+Shift+F grabs the full tab).

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,100
The answer streams into an in-page card, no other chatbot opens.

5
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:20,100
Copy or regenerate the answer, with KaTeX math rendering.

6
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:24,100
Ask bot lets you ask follow-up questions in the same card.

7
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:28,100
Select any text and the selection toolbar appears.

8
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:32,100
The menu: Copy, Highlight, Read aloud, Explain, Translate, Summarize and more. Pin your favourites.

9
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,100
Pick a target language to translate the selection.

10
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:40,100
Results appear in a card: edit the question, switch model, or continue in chat.

11
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:44,100
Follow-ups keep context and render math cleanly.

12
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:48,100
Load unpacked, add your own Gemini key, and press Alt+Shift+S. MIT licensed.
